title: "Cosmos, Nowness, Eternities (CNE / CINI): Open Civic Commons Corpus & Archival Framework"
message: "If you reference, build upon, or archive any module from the Cosmos, Nowness, Eternities (CNE / CINI) Open Civic Commons, please cite it using the metadata below."
