license: CC-BY-4.0

abstract: >-
  Cosmos, Nowness, Eternities (CNE / CINI) is a non-profit, non-ownership
  civic initiative and Open Civic Commons dedicated to rebooting scientific
  knowledge, advancing human identity through cosmic humility, and encoding
  non-relational compassion across Deep Time. Incorporating foundational
  syntheses on relational time, scientific instrumentation outreach
  (CINI-MOD-OUTREACH-01), intelligent life proposals (CINI-MOD-INTEL-01),
  historical hindsight across Great Multitudes (CINI-MOD-HIST-01), and
  structural mercy toward sentient co-travelers through Animal Equity
  (CINI-MOD-ANIM-01), all records are archived openly under CC-BY-4.0.

